     4194         gds-zap-other      format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" when (p2 = 1) @  gds-zap-other
     4195         with FRAME ZAPAS .
     4196    if  p2 > 10  then f_e = 10 .
     4197                 else f_e =  0 .
